  "local_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-31d1c91359b57ac9",
      "text": "In colocalization studies, LNP exhibited specific expression of ZsGreen protein in macrophages of fibrotic mice, with no detectable expression in other hepatic cell types",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-31d1c91359b57ac9",
        "source_id": "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-197c0d55a09731fa",
      "text": "Conversely, unmodified LNP operates independently of CD163-mediated uptake, resulting in substantial ZsGreen/CD163 colocalization, thereby indirectly corroborating the targeting function of conjugated antibodies (SI Appendix, Fig.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-197c0d55a09731fa",
        "source_id": "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-730aaa4eea997e6f",
      "text": "We found that the LNP group had a lower proportion of HSCs than the Fibrosis group.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-9a8b8f55dd34f16d"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-730aaa4eea997e6f",
        "source_id": "FC-S-9a8b8f55dd34f16d",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-72c5d70fe8a4c2a3",
      "text": "In the αCD163/LNP-ZsGreen cohort, surface CD163 expression was markedly diminished, with minimal overlap between ZsGreen+ and CD163+ populations.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-72c5d70fe8a4c2a3",
        "source_id": "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-1dc71dae4927710a",
      "text": "In the Fibrosis group, PCNA expression was significantly increased in HSCs\nPCNA expression was almost absent in Heps",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-9a8b8f55dd34f16d"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-1dc71dae4927710a",
        "source_id": "FC-S-9a8b8f55dd34f16d",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-67cba83633b522b0",
      "text": "By transfecting target cells with luciferase, we quantified the killing effect, and the results demonstrated that the CAR-M derived from αCD163/LNP-FAPCAR significantly eliminated the FAP+JS-1 target cells in vitro (Fig.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-5f7e3c49e57be4bb"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-67cba83633b522b0",
        "source_id": "FC-S-5f7e3c49e57be4bb",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-80c6ec1cbc3e9a46",
      "text": "In contrast, unmodified LNPs delivered mRNA to fewer than 20% of target BMDMs in vitro (Fig.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-be45df6ef11313b3"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-80c6ec1cbc3e9a46",
        "source_id": "FC-S-be45df6ef11313b3",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-a5f4eb9b5d252ba0",
      "text": "Notably, the αCD163/LNP-FAPCAR cohort achieved the most pronounced fibrosis regression.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-b842c4f3d32bf804"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-a5f4eb9b5d252ba0",
        "source_id": "FC-S-b842c4f3d32bf804",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-e75218514098ec17",
      "text": "The results demonstrated that, compared with HSCs induced solely by TGF-β1, HSCs exposed to MMP12+macrophage-conditioned medium (CM) expressed fewer fibrosis-related proteins and mRNAs (Fig.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-a6f2290dacffb34f"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-e75218514098ec17",
        "source_id": "FC-S-a6f2290dacffb34f",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-3100ed6c7942dfbf",
      "text": "The results showed that BMDMs, especially those treated with αCD163/LNP-FAPCAR, significantly promoted the expression of the M1 marker CD80 (Fig.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-5f7e3c49e57be4bb"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-3100ed6c7942dfbf",
        "source_id": "FC-S-5f7e3c49e57be4bb",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-1cea560b4cc4ad0e",
      "text": "Notably, over 80% of the BMDMs expressed GFP or FAPCAR upon exposure to αCD163/LNP-GFP or αCD163/LNP-FAPCAR, respectively.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-be45df6ef11313b3"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-1cea560b4cc4ad0e",
        "source_id": "FC-S-be45df6ef11313b3",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-028bd91acc9c0900",
      "text": "We found that more Heps (ALB+) in the LNP group expressed PCNA\nHSCs (Desmin+) showed almost no PCNA expression.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-9a8b8f55dd34f16d"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-028bd91acc9c0900",
        "source_id": "FC-S-9a8b8f55dd34f16d",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-c875326964896b03",
      "text": "Notably, the αCD163/LNP-FAPCAR group could induce higher Mmp12 gene expression, and no significant effect on the gene expression of Mmp9 and Mmp13 (Fig.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-5f7e3c49e57be4bb"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-c875326964896b03",
        "source_id": "FC-S-5f7e3c49e57be4bb",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-cc8b40e6727c590c",
      "text": "4 M and N, the treatment with LNP reduced the expression of FAP+HSCs and α-sma+HSCs.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-c24a83d5d094287e"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-cc8b40e6727c590c",
        "source_id": "FC-S-c24a83d5d094287e",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-f945a79d5d56831e",
      "text": "In stark contrast, the αCD163/LNP-ZsGreen cohort displayed reduced CD163 positivity and a markedly diminished proportion of ZsGreen+/CD163+ double-positive macrophages (SI Appendix, Fig.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-f945a79d5d56831e",
        "source_id": "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-2749728b21beb464",
      "text": "Meanwhile, the αCD163/LNP-FAPCAR group reduced the expression of the M2 marker CD206 (Fig.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-5f7e3c49e57be4bb"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
        "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-2749728b21beb464",
        "source_id": "FC-S-5f7e3c49e57be4bb",
        "locator_type": "text",
        "row_label": null,
        "column_label": null,
        "panel_label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-96045cb4ab6274c3",
      "text": "(Scale bar, 10 μm.) (J) Representative GFP expression in BMDMs through flow cytometry and (K) the analysis of GFP expression.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-75e69a2f0aa58a3a",
        "FC-S-75e69a2f0aa58a3a"
      ],
      "source_kind": "text",
      "provenance": {
